<title>POLAND: Polisa up 12.5 percent in bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Polisa up 12.5 percent in bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurer TUR Polisa SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at nine zlotys, 12.5 percent above its public offering price of eight zlotys.</p>
<p>Late last year the firm's initial public offering of 3.2 million shares was about 37-percent subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
